## 5. Business rules

- Users should be able to enter their travel dates, city they are visiting, budget, how many people they're traveling with (children vs adults), and save their activity preferences locally.
- The output will show things that will be open during their travel dates and the costs associated.
- Users can input if they have a rental car or not and it will show them public transportation near each activity.

## 6. Building and integrating

- **Machine-readable copy:** This document will always match the repo. Name will be updated later.
- **Parallel work:** We are working on the two different components and then will swap.
- **Automated check:** CI runs contract tests against the API on every pull request. A failure blocks the merge.

| Milestone | What must work |
